# Immich library

List libraries, albums, assets, people, and jobs status. Prefer MCP when
connected (`global-mcp-first`); else Immich API or authenticated UI.

Never invent album / asset / person ids — list/resolve first. Report counts and
ids — do not dump original media bytes or EXIF that embeds secrets into chat.
